      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-13-005\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24441]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>5</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>. P</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>ATIENT AND PUBLIC INVOLVEMENT</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong> </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24442]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pts and public can be engaged in a variety of ways</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24443]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Patient advisory and liaison services</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24444]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Quantitative pts surveys (questionnaires)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24445]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Qualitative pts surveys (depth interview, focus groups)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24446]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pts stories and diaries/observational studies</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24447]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Workshops and conferences</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24448]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Consultation with pt representative and group</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24449]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pts forums, council and panels</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24450]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pt representative committee and group</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24451]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Patient advisory liaison services </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>PALS</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24452]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Where pts can enroll their complaints</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24453]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Whether they are annoyed, pleased or need inquiry</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24454]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u>PALS statement</u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24455]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Happy: tell us</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24456]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Enquiry: let us help you</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24457]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Un</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ha</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ppy: let us resolve together</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24458]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Pts complaints</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24459]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>1.PALS:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24460]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pts lodges their complaints at local level</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24461]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Majority of complaints are resoled locally</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24462]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>If not satisfied then refer to ombudsman</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24463]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>2.</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Ombudsman</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24464]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Parliamentary health services</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24465]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Undertake independent investigations</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> to complaints that has not been settled at the local level.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24466]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24467]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24468]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24469]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-p